@title Schematic: the EMC fix preview keeps the net-class panel narrow (1366)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Pick a motor-cable wire with EMC net classes on and open "Preview: Use a shielded cable.": the panel stays its own width (wrapping the preview text) and does not grow over the right half of the drawing; Apply and Cancel stay in reach.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 8
key PageDown
wait 12
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc net classes
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
click 152 420
wait 12
expect "Cable =A1+CAB-W2"
shot before-preview
scroll 1180 400 2000
wait 8
click_text "Preview: Use a shielded cable." #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Apply (one undo step)"
shot preview-open
check_layout
